The {{SYSTEM_NAME}} component catalog — what exists, its published key, its variants — vendored from
the DS repo so the studio context can instance components without round-tripping. Until populated,
read keys from the DS repo or a fresh `tools/inventory-snippet.js` run.

---

## Instantiate-by-key convention

Instance by **published component key** via `importComponentByKeyAsync(KEY)` → `main.createInstance()`.
Keys are 40 hex chars — copy the FULL key from a fresh inventory (truncated → "not found", Gotcha #13).
`importComponentByKeyAsync` returns the last *published* version; stale consumer instances need a swap
(Gotcha #20 → use the `rebind` skill).

